  "title": "Discover held EU legislation"
 },
 "description": "Use this to discover which EU instruments are held before a coverage question, or find their registry ids and legal status. Paginated, filterable by status, category, core/supplementary, and by whether an instrument was in force on a given date. For corpus-coverage questions, filter by category here, enumerate each instrument with list_provisions, then open what you need with get_provision.",
